This is an HQ workspace. Follow the HQ charter in `.claude/CLAUDE.md`
(the same file Claude Code loads). `AGENTS.md` at the repo root is a
symlink to that charter.

Cursor project rules live in `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` (MDC format used by
